{"id":"841985de31202f85","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-provability-predicate.md","title":"Provability Predicate","display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-provability-predicate","aliases":["89-df-provability-predicate"],"display":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate","depends_on":["[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","[[../88/88-df-godel-numbering]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-provability-predicate"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-provability-predicate</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-provability-predicate — Provability Predicate"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"2e7227755a8473e0\" href=\"?note=2e7227755a8473e0\" title=\"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus\">89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"../88/88-df-godel-numbering\">../88/88-df-godel-numbering</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 是递归可枚举公理化的理论，固定其枚举程序及上一原子的经典演算。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"56061e16f3fb8bfd\" href=\"?note=56061e16f3fb8bfd\" title=\"../88/88-df-godel-numbering\">../88/88-df-godel-numbering</a> 的编码接口，进一步选择标准原始递归的语法、序列及替换编码。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)\">\\(\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)\\)</span> 为有限证书检查关系：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"y\">\\(y\\)</span> 解码为非空证明及其逐行理由，末行码为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span>；逻辑公理、MP、全称化按演算检查，理论公理附上枚举程序输出该公理的有限运行证书。无效编码检查为假。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>固定直接编码该标准校验过程的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 表示公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x)\\)</span>，采用 PA 可验证的语法、序列、运行证书编码及证明拼接变换；其在标准结构中的数词实例恰与检查结果一致。这里只选通常的证明算术化，不以任意标准模型外延相同的公式替代它。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2\\)</span> 和单自由变元公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)\\)</span> 是下述定义的数值关系和对象公式。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Prf}_T&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(y,x)\\in\\mathbb N^2\\mid\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists y\\,\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x),\\\\\n(y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Proof}_T(\\bar y,\\bar x),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\n\\quad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Prf}_T&amp;\\coloneqq\\{(y,x)\\in\\mathbb N^2\\mid\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)&amp;\\coloneqq\\exists y\\,\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x),\\\\\n(y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Proof}_T(\\bar y,\\bar x),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\n\\quad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 2 章，印刷页 34–44；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\)</span> 是元语言中的数值关系；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Proof}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Proof}_T\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prov}_T\">\\(\\mathrm{Prov}_T\\)</span> 是对象语言公式。对象公式中的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists y\">\\(\\exists y\\)</span> 是算术量词，不能混写成集合论的“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>”。公理集仅可枚举时，上述枚举证书保证检查仍原始递归；对 PA 可以直接判定公理模式。原书直接算术化 PA 的有限证明；对任意仅可枚举理论加枚举证书，是本目录为明确该通用接口而作的扩展，不声称原书原式含这些证书。表示公式固定后，派生条件还须另证，不能仅由外延相同推出。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus","status":"resolved","id":"2e7227755a8473e0","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-arithmetical-proof-calculus]]","embed":false},{"target":"../88/88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../88/88-df-godel-numbering]]","embed":false},{"target":"../88/88-df-godel-numbering","status":"resolved","id":"56061e16f3fb8bfd","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"采用 [[../88/88-df-godel-numbering]] 的编码接口，进一步选择标准原始递归的语法、序列及替换编码。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)","display":false},{"tex":"y","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"\\Sigma_1","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_T\\subseteq\\mathbb N^2","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}provability\\text{-}predicate}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{Prf}_T&\\coloneqq\\{(y,x)\\in\\mathbb N^2\\mid\\mathsf{Check}_T(y,x)\\},\\\\\n\\mathrm{Prov}_T(x)&\\coloneqq\\exists y\\,\\mathrm{Proof}_T(y,x),\\\\\n(y,x)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathbb N\\models\\mathrm{Proof}_T(\\bar y,\\bar x),\\\\\nT\\vdash_{\\mathrm{ar}}\\varphi\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N\\ ((y,\\ulcorner\\varphi\\urcorner)\\in\\mathrm{Prf}_T)\n\\quad(\\varphi\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prf}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Proof}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prov}_T","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists y","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists y\\in\\mathbb N","display":false}],"bytes":2674,"backlinks":[{"id":"646431d492b9ae8a","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"55612987d4585fa4","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)$ is the one-free-variable arithmetical\nprovability formula fixed in [[89-df-provability-predicate]]."},{"id":"00938a3b569dba72","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Prov}_{T}(x)$ is its standard one-free-variable provability\nformula from [[89-df-provability-predicate]]."},{"id":"bf19f2410ce0d03b","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"该记号与 [[89-df-provability-predicate]] 中作用于 Gödel 编码的\n$\\mathrm{Len}(y)$ 区分开。"},{"id":"4cc05e68647fcda4","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9aca87310232fb2f","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6cbce44a943995a0","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"e